sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Client as API client
    participant API as cmd/api
    participant Rules as Rule service
    participant Compiler as Rule compiler
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Client->>API: POST /v1/rules/{ruleSet}/revisions
    API->>Rules: Activate(tenantScope, ruleSet, source, actor)
    Rules->>Compiler: Compile(source)
    alt Source is invalid
        Compiler-->>Rules: Validation error
        Rules-->>API: Error
        API-->>Client: 4xx response
    else Source is valid
        Compiler-->>Rules: Immutable RuleRevision (compiled + hash)
        Rules->>DB: Save rule revision
        Rules->>DB: Set active revision for tenant + rule set
        DB-->>Rules: RuleActivation
        Rules-->>API: RuleActivation
        API-->>Client: 200 OK
    end
    Note over DB: Rule revisions are immutable.<br/>Activation selects one revision per tenant + rule set.
